      "description": "The first vulnerability-relevant project read on the crashing path is the ClientHello parser reading the attacker-controlled session-ID length byte from the raw handshake. That byte becomes the session-id length used to locate both the cipher-suite length field and the start of the cipher-suite array."
    },
