      "verified_by": "a_requested_cipher_suite_pointer_reaches_read",
      "fine_trace_step": 10,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer reports the crash when `getCipherSuiteID()` dereferences the unchecked `index`th 2-byte cipher-suite slot. On the witnessed path that pointer is past the valid message bytes, producing the saved heap-buffer-overflow READ of size 2."
